TestDialogue:
	'''
	Aimacra joined us on our excursion as well so be sure to get a hold of her whenever you can. 
	This world is corrupt with power and I'm sending you to purge it, I'm a bit too tired to do anything right now. I was playing my piano for too long.
	'''
ZuiOpenDialogue1: Well, you seem to be having quite a bit of fun around here! What's up?
ZuiIdleChat1:
	'''
	I'm glad you decided to enroll at our little magic school!
	I'm sure you will find that there are lots for you to learn here
	Have fun!!!
	'''
CauldronCraftingDialogue:
	'''
	You want to enroll at my magic school? Great!
	Let's get you started then, you see that cauldron over there?
	I want you to take these mushrooms and cook something with it. I think you'll be surprised at what comes out!
	'''
CauldronOpenDialogue: Do you want to brew?
